CORE
main.sh
--shell-strings refined --unwind 10 --no-unwinding-assertions
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[assertion\.1\] .*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Each unwinding of the loop has string calls, but a model only runs a few:
the axioms of the others only hold where their calls happen. With the
axioms holding everywhere, this took 13 s and 1.1 GB instead of 2.5 s.
